<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>Nexora Solutions</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background: #f4f4f4;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background: #1a2b4c;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            margin-left: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .hero {
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        .services {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            padding: 40px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            max-width: 250px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Nexora Solutions</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/login">Client Login</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h2>Enterprise Cloud Consulting &amp; Managed IT Services</h2>
        <p>Nexora Solutions helps growing businesses modernize their infrastructure, secure their data, and scale with
            confidence.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
        <div class="service-card">
            <h3>Cloud Migration</h3>
            <p>We migrate your legacy systems to secure, scalable cloud infrastructure with zero downtime.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
            <h3>Cybersecurity Audits</h3>
            <p>Our security experts identify vulnerabilities before attackers do, protecting your clients and your
                reputation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
            <h3>Client Support Portal</h3>
            <p>Our clients manage their accounts, invoices, and support tickets directly through their dashboard.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 Nexora Solutions. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</body>

</html>